<!-- start: About Section -->
<section class="h6-about-section my-5">
  <div class="container mt-5">
    <div class="row">
       <div class="row flex-lg-row flex-column-reverse">
         <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-8 ">
      <div class="h6-about-content">
          <div class="sec-heading style-2">
            <span class="sub-title wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.3s">Who We Are</span>
            <h2 class="sec-title tj-text-invert">Fractional General Counsel for the Business You Are Building</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
     
    <p>We work alongside your leadership team, providing ongoing legal counsel as your business grows, evolves, and makes decisions that shape its future.</p>
    <p>As businesses grow, legal considerations become part of everyday decision-making and not just individual transactions or disputes. Contracts, compliance, people, technology, expansion, and investments all require timely legal input. Without ongoing legal guidance, routine decisions can create unnecessary risk, slow business progress, or result in costly issues later.</p>
    <p>Our Fractional General Counsel model provides ongoing access to experienced legal counsel which is integrated with your business. We work alongside founders, promoters, boards, leadership teams, and in-house legal providing practical guidance across corporate law, commercial contracts, governance, regulatory compliance, risk, and strategic business matters.</p>
    <p>Rather than stepping in only when a legal issue arises, we work alongside your leadership team bringing continuity, context, and legal support aligned with how your business operates.</p>
    <div class="vd-about-highlights">

    <div class="vd-highlight">
