<!-- start: Approach Section (redesigned — numbered list, simple fade-up reveal) -->
<section class="tj-approach-section section-space">
  <div class="container   ">
      <div class="h6-about-content">
          <div class="sec-heading style-2 text-center">
            <span class="sub-title wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.3s">The Vidhitra Approach</span>
            <h2 class="sec-title tj-text-invert">Legal Counsel Built Around Your Business</h2>
            <p>Effective legal counsel begins with understanding the business behind the legal issue. We bring business context, continuity, practical judgment, and the flexibility to respond as priorities change.</p>
          </div>
      </div>

    <div class="tj-approach-layout">

      <div class="tj-approach-list">

        <div class="tj-approach-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.1s">
          <div class="tj-approach-number"><span>1</span></div>
          <div class="tj-approach-content">
            <h3 class="title">We start with the business, not just the legal question</h3>
            <p class="desc">The legal issue is rarely the whole issue. We first understand what the business is trying to achieve, what is changing, and what the decision needs to accomplish. We then bring the legal perspective into that context.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tj-approach-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s">
          <div class="tj-approach-number"><span>2</span></div>
          <div class="tj-approach-content">
            <h3 class="title">We build context that compounds over time</h3>
            <p class="desc">With ongoing counsel, each matter is informed by what came before. Over time, we develop a deeper understanding of your business, its priorities, operating environment, and how decisions are made. That context reduces repetition and makes our counsel more relevant, practical, and commercially informed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tj-approach-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.3s">
          <div class="tj-approach-number"><span>3</span></div>
          <div class="tj-approach-content">
            <h3 class="title">We help leadership weigh the decision, not just the risk</h3>
            <p class="desc">Legal advice is most valuable when it helps leadership evaluate the available paths, not simply identify risk. We help clarify what matters, where the exposure lies, what can be negotiated, and the practical steps that can move the business forward.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tj-approach-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.4s">
          <div class="tj-approach-number"><span>4</span></div>
          <div class="tj-approach-content">
            <h3 class="title">We provide continuity as your business evolves</h3>
            <p class="desc">As your business grows and its priorities evolve, so does the legal support it requires. Our Fractional General Counsel model provides ongoing access to experienced legal counsel, providing continuity while adapting to your evolving business and priorities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Sticky visual — stays in view as the person scrolls the steps -->
      <div class="tj-approach-visual">
        <div class="tj-approach-visual-inner">
          <img src="assets/images/vidhitra/approach/approach1.png" alt="The Vidhitra Approach">
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
<!-- end: Approach Section -->

